      "issues": [
        "- In the table under Part 3 (Alligation का विस्तार), the caution for Speed states \"सावधानी: तभी लागू जब दोनों खंडों का समय बराबर हो\" which is incorrect; alligation for average speed works for any time segments (weights), not only when times are equal. → Correct the caution to indicate that alligation applies when weights are times; if distances are equal, alligation cannot be directly applied with distances as weights."
